  "content": "<h3><code>也可在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fclean-connected-glass\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#1bd96a\">Modrinth</span></a> 获取</code></h3>\n<h1><strong>需要 Optifine 或&nbsp;<span style=\"color:#f16436\"><a style=\"color:#f16436\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/continuity\" rel=\"nofollow\">Continuity</a></span> 才能生效</strong></h1>\n<hr>\n<h2><strong>Continuity 用户须知</strong></h2>\n<p>（请展开查看）</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>如果您在使用玻璃板时遇到以下问题，请确保启用 Continuity 自带的“玻璃板剔除修复”资源包，并将其置于本资源包之上！</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1763/256/glass-pane-culing-issue-img-png.png\" alt=\"Continuity 与玻璃板问题\" width=\"45%\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1763/255/glass-pane-culing-issue-fix-png.png\" alt=\"Continuity 的玻璃板剔除修复\" width=\"45%\"></p>\n</div>\n<hr>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:18px\">为玻璃添加无条纹的连接纹理。仅此而已！</span></h1>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong>本资源包更改了以下方块：</strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>所有玻璃方块</li>\n<li>所有玻璃板</li>\n<li>着色玻璃和着色玻璃板</li>\n</ul>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\">希望您喜欢！ :D</span></h4>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px\">查看<span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a style=\"color:#e67e23\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/clean-connected-glass/gallery\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"color:#f16436\">画廊</span></a></span></span></h4>",
